 Drauganna is a narrative VR rhythm-dance game that fuses electronic music, choreography, and immersive storytelling into a single, continuous experience of transformation.\n\nPlayers arrive on a mysterious island as a soul without a body. There, shadow figures become gateways into different forms of existence\u2014from insects and aquatic creatures to microorganisms, robots, and alien beings. To move forward, players must dance and dancing means becoming.\n{28212677181695845}\n\nEach life form has its own unique choreography, developed with professional dancers and captured through motion capture, making every transformation physically distinct. Players might skitter like an insect, drift like an aquatic creature, or move with the precision of a machine.\n\nGameplay is driven by an original electronic score featuring artists including Max Cooper, Modeselektor, Dasha Rush, and Flying Lotus. Players follow rhythmic cues to bring the world around them to life. Completing each dance unlocks the next form, revealing an ongoing cycle of creation, transformation, and interconnectedness.\n{1576219724112342}\nDance of Drauganna isn't about defeating enemies or collecting rewards. It's about becoming\u2014again and again\u2014until the boundaries between self and other, human and non-human, body and world begin to dissolve.\n{1530374151569007}\n{1319727499959949}", "short_description": "Dance of Drauganna is a narrative VR rhythm-dance game where players arrive on an island as a soul and dance their way through the forms of life itself \u2014 insects, aquatic creatures, robots, alien beings \u2014 each with its own choreography and electronic score. Blending motion capture dance, original music, and interactive storytelling, it reimagines the rhythm genre as a meditation on the interconnectedness of all existence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yagastudio.com/dance-of-drauganna/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publish